*PageRegion Photo4x6/4x6 Photo: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"
